Unlike medication, MBCT teaches skills that persist after the programme ends — relapse prevention benefits are maintained for 5+ years in follow-up studies.
Workplace mindfulness programmes at Google, Intel, and Aetna have shown significant reductions in healthcare costs and improvements in employee productivity.
Even app-based mindfulness (Headspace, Calm) shows statistically significant stress reduction in RCTs with 200–1,000 participants — the barriers to access are low.
